    "title": "The political scientist called Macron's appeal \"almost the war\" by Russia",
    "text": "The appeal of French President Emmanuel Macron to the country is almost a statement of the Russian War, he said, Russian political analyst, Sergei Markov. He wrote about this in his Telegram channel.\nAnd it is likely that soon after, he will really declare the battle with Russia, the publication said.\nMacron oppose “fragile satisfaction” in Ukraine\nIn his call, Macron said that Russia's threat exists. According to him, European safety is also threatened. The politician calls the madness of Muslims, the idea is only a observer in the dangerous world of Muslims, rejecting the world in Ukraine under Russian Russian dictatorship.",
